17. Recommended Next Phase

After MVP closure, prioritize improvements according to evidence rather than adding every possible feature.

Potential next-phase directions include:

Expand Ready Designs within the services that showed the strongest completion and demand.

Add richer AI-assisted adaptation while preserving design rules.

Analyze uploaded reference images to improve Taste Profiles.

Improve ranking with consented recommendation feedback.

Strengthen team formation for multi-service projects.

Add more advanced creator revenue and licensing workflows.

Expand workspace coordination and managed project capabilities.

Add new sectors only after the initial taxonomy and matching quality are stable.

Each proposed feature should have a user problem, success metric, rights assessment, and technical estimate before entering development.

